K-π's K-stack (`packages/coding-agent/src/kpi/kstack/`) is a vendored,
rewritten overlay of pstack's principles, playbooks, and workflow skills. It is
replayed onto new upstream pstack trees rather than hand-merged, and it is never
installed as a runtime dependency. See `docs/kstack.md`.

